        "event": "High Wind Warning",
        "headline": "High Wind Warning issued April 30 at 10:15AM AKDT until May 2 at 4:00PM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...South winds 30 to 50 mph with gusts up to 75 mph expected.\n\n* WHERE...Eastern Alaska Range North of Trims Camp and Windy Pass.\n\n* WHEN...From 4 PM this afternoon to 4 PM AKDT Saturday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Strong winds could blow down trees and power lines.\nIsolated power outages are possible. Travel could be very\ndifficult, especially for high profile vehicles.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...The strongest winds will occur between early\nFriday morning and Friday evening.",
        "severity": "Severe",
        "certainty": "Likely",
        "urgency": "Expected",
        "sender": "NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "effective": "2026-04-30T10:15:00-08:00",
        "expires": "2026-05-01T07:30:00-08:00",
        "areas": "Northern Denali Borough; Eastern Alaska Range North of Trims Camp",
        "category": "Met",
        "response": "Prepare",
        "instruction": "Remain in the lower levels of your home during the windstorm, and\navoid windows. Watch for falling debris and tree limbs. Use caution\nif you must drive.",
        "lat": null,
        "lng": null
      },
